=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Faursel} (Neptune's Spire J-8) for a cutscene.
* He will give you three options to choose from. The third is a hidden option on the bottom. Choose the hidden option.
* Talk to {n:Faursel} a second time for another cutscene and choose "I want to go".
* {n:Faursel} will give you four ways to proceed: the Advanced path, the Intermediate path, the Beginner path, or paying 500,000 {p:Gil}.
* Collect the required item(s) for Faursel. See the options below for your options.
** **{c=red:Tip!}** You can buy Coffer Keys from the {p:Curio Moogle} for 5,000 Gil if you have the {@k} {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"}. If you have not progressed in {p:Rhapsodies of Vana'diel}, now it is by far the easiest choice even though it is "Advanced".
* Trade the requested item(s) to him. He will tell you to return tomorrow.
* Zone and return to {z:Lower Jeuno} the next game day. Talk to {n:Faursel} again to obtain the {@k} {k:Boarding permit}.
** If you wish to skip obtaining the request items, you can pay him 500,000 {p:Gil}.
*** If you choose to pay the gil, you must change zones and return to {z:Lower Jeuno} the next game day. Then talk to Faursel and you will receive the {@k} {k:Boarding permit} and {k:Map of Wajaom Woodlands} and be teleported to the Leypoint in {z:Wajaom Woodlands}.
** If you chose not to pay the gil, you are instructed to go to {z:Mhaura} and ride the ship to {z:Al Zahbi}.
*** {n:Laughing Bison} (Mhaura I-9) will tell you whether the next ship will sail for Al Zahbi or Selbina, as will {n:Dieh Yamilsiah} once you've entered the boarding area.
*** If you have joined a {p:Unity} and have (or get) 100 {p:Unity Accolades}, you may skip the boat ride by using a {p:Unity Warp} with any {p:Unity NPC} -- But you **must first obtain the {@k} {k:Boarding permit}** to unlock the Aht Urghan warp options.
**** 125 {z:Wajaom Woodlands} option, and then chocobo/run to Al Zhabi, and then through there to Aht Urghan Whitegate.
* After completing this quest approach {p:Naja Salaheem} at {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (I-10) to begin {M:Aht Urhgan Mission 1: Land of Sacred Serpents|Aht Urhgan Mission 1|Land of Sacred Serpents}.

\**{c=red:Note:}** If you are on {M:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission|Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission|Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission} 2-5, simply select "Where's Tenzen?" and you will get a {@k} {k:Boarding permit} for free.
\**{c=black:Note:}** The NPC {n:Jijiroon} in {z:Nashmau} will later say: "Jijiroon saaaw boat flying throoo air over Wawaaam Wooodland, and--whoosh!--out flew adventooorer! That loook fun."
=3 Advanced Path
Trade any one of the following:
+ One coffer key from a beastman stronghold:
++ {z:Davoi}
++ {z:Beadeaux}
++ {z:Castle Oztroja}
++ {z:Temple of Uggalepih}
++ {z:Den of Rancor}
++ {z:Quicksand Caves}
++ {z:Sea Serpent Grotto}
+ Any testimony item.
+ Three (3) chips from Pso'Xja:
++ {i:Carmine Chip|Carmine Chip|1692}
++ {i:Cyan Chip|Cyan Chip|1693}
++ {i:Gray Chip|Gray Chip|1694}

=3 Intermediate Path
Trade the following Garrison items:
* {i:Jade Cryptex|Jade Cryptex|1532}
* {i:Silver Engraving|Silver Engraving|1533}
* {i:13 Knot Quipus}

=3 Beginner Path
Obtain the 6 items that are used in the two sub-job quests:
* {i:Magicked Skull|Magicked Skull|538}
* {i:Damselfly Worm|Damselfly Worm|537}
* {i:Crab Apron|Crab Apron|539}
* {i:Bloody Robe|Bloody Robe|540}
* {i:Dhalmel Saliva|Dhalmel Saliva|541}
* {i:Wild Rabbit Tail|Wild Rabbit Tail|542}

